OL,3,ABurnham refuses to rule out tax rises
OL,4,Ain autumn Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham became prime minister in July
OL,7,Fpromising to give people breathing
OL,8,Fspace and help with the cost of living,
OL,9,Fbut questions remain over how major
OL,10,Fpolicies such as social care reforms
OL,11,Fwill be funded.
OL,13,FExperts have previously warned that he
OL,14,Fand Chancellor John Healey will have
OL,15,Flittle financial room to manoeuvre in
OL,16,Ftheir first Budget on 28 October.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
